    "text": "Conjecture: Let G be a finite additive abelian group with |G| odd. Then any\nsubset A of G with |A| = n > 2 can be written as {a1 , . . . , an } in such a way that all\nthe sums a1 + a2 , a2 + a3 , . . . , an−1 + an , an + a1 are distinct.          Z. W. Sun",
